WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.500
What's the point of using these technologies

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.800
if we're just gonna stay in the metaverse?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.500
We should be using them to create better conditions on Earth.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.450
So, like I like to say, it's really important we ground these technologies

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.100
to place-based projects, to land-based projects,

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.400
to create better conditions here on Earth.
